**Request \[[Create API Key](https://ultracart.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ucdoc/pages/38688545/API+Simple+Key)\]**
```bash
curl -X POST "https://secure.ultracart.com/rest/v2/auto_order/auto_orders/query\\ \
?_limit=2&_offset=0&_sort=next_shipment_dts&_expand=items%2Citems.future_schedules%2Coriginal_order%2Crebill_orders" \
  -H "Accept: application/json" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-UltraCart-Api-Version: 2017-03-01" \
  -H "x-ultracart-simple-key: 9e188d66d77f64019a05ae05ac80010039ccbebb1df9b9019a05ae05ac800100" \
  -d $'{
    "email": "support@ultracart.com"
}'
```

